  ms       the registry of five-argument members
  x1       the first input
  x2       the second input
  x3       the third input
  x4       the fourth input
  x5       the fifth input
  N        how many entries a result has
  ncmp     how many leading entries are compared
  tol      the largest relative deviation allowed
  rep      the report, filled for the caller
  release  `1` when the program runs in release mode
  R        the consensus

sw_check5_arr  @0e70f3bf
  what  Run a five-argument registry, copy the consensus into `out`, and return
