  why   The asserting form a scalar stage calls, as `sweep3_arr` is for arrays.
  ms       the registry of scalar-valued members
  x1       the first input
  x2       the second input
  x3       the third input
  tol      the largest relative deviation allowed
  rep      the report, filled for the caller
  release  `1` when the program runs in release mode
  v        the median answer

sw_check3_num  @f4bc8ec1
  why   The non-asserting form, for tests that plant a bad scalar member
