sw_anchor  @1b2d4a27
  what  Call every driver of this module once with a one-member registry of
        the matching signature. It is never run.
  why   The compiler types a driver's registry parameter from its call sites.
        A program that uses `sweep3_arr` but never `sweep5_arr` would leave
        `sweep5_arr` with no call site, and its registry parameter would be
        typed as a number, so the program would not compile.
  entry the compiler, which types each driver's registry parameter from these
        calls; never run
  x     a placeholder array for every array argument
  rep   a report for the calls
  out   a place for the check drivers' consensus
  a     the three-array driver's result
  b     the five-array driver's result
  c     the `(nmax, x)` driver's result
  v     the scalar driver's result, then the check drivers' verdicts added

sw_cov_new  @a340c123
  why   The coverage counters record which strategies checked which classes of
        input (ERI shell classes, Boys regions, SCF regimes), so a build can
        fail when a class was checked by only one strategy.
  nclass  how many classes the table has, one row each

sw_cov_hit  @06cdd362
